*  s189 (seat6, row fuzz-diff-batch) REDUCED WITNESS.  GREEN CONTROL for fzr_22: one ARBNO level instead of two.  Passes.
          P             =  ('' | '') ARBNO(REM) FENCE(SPAN('abc'))
          'abcabc' POS(0) *P RPOS(0)                          :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
